Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.02,0:00:07.69,Default,,0,0,900,,Angels and demons were circling over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.69,0:00:13.40,Default,,0,0,900,,Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:19.07,Default,,0,0,900,,He who does not perceive his calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.90,0:00:25.48,Default,,0,0,900,,does not know true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:31.28,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.85,0:00:37.02,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.62,0:00:42.83,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.03,0:00:48.23,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.33,0:01:00.58,Default,,0,0,900,,I am calling, calling now.\NSpirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.05,0:01:06.05,Default,,0,0,900,,To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.32,0:01:12.36,Default,,0,0,900,,Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.39,0:01:17.86,Default,,0,0,900,,in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.33,0:01:23.83,Default,,0,0,900,,To stay myself longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.83,0:01:29.24,Default,,0,0,900,,The flow may swallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.30,0:01:32.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.59,0:01:33.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.67,0:01:35.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He is an extremely unstable condition right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.68,0:01:37.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.14,0:01:42.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please take a look at my memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.81,0:01:45.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was the Ministry of Health,\NLabour and Welfare, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.10,0:01:47.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I didn't get shot in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.60,0:01:49.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Intubate!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.11,0:01:49.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.98,0:01:55.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,While he undergoes surgery, extract the last\Nsixteen hours of memories from his cyberbrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.19,0:01:55.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.07,0:01:57.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.49,0:02:00.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We must have that information at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.25,0:02:10.65,Default,,300,0,500,,{\b1\i1}Traces \N Left\NBehind{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:12.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.09,0:02:13.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It must be a side-effect of anesthetics.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.67,0:02:15.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There is too much noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.01,0:02:18.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The input will even include\Nhis emotional ups and downs,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.05,0:02:21.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,so our perceptions may be\Ninfluenced by them as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:22.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.85,0:02:23.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.93,0:02:26.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,His heartbeat is abnormally high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.31,0:02:33.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That idiot... Of course he's going to\Nget downed if he's feeling this heroic!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.65,0:02:38.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's summarize the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.65,0:02:44.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa deduced that the hackers at the\Nvocational aid centre were after paper media?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.33,0:02:47.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and he subsequently made frequent visits to the Ministry of\NHealth, Labour and Welfare in order to confirm his suspicions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.75,0:02:52.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In the process, he found that a list was\Nmissing from a vast collection of documents.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.75,0:02:56.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And that was the list of Murai\Nvaccine recipients, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.34,0:02:57.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.34,0:03:02.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's unclear, but it seems that Togusa visited\Nthe Sunflower Society, which needed the list,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.55,0:03:04.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and became caught up in an assault there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.72,0:03:06.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It {\i1}is{\i} clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.43,0:03:08.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was Narcotics who gunned Togusa down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.64,0:03:11.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This means that the assault team,\Nwhich specialises in vicious crimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.15,0:03:14.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,is going around massacring civilians!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.44,0:03:17.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Their intent was to seize the file by force\Nor to eradicate it from existence, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.74,0:03:21.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The fact that Imakurusu's name was on the\Nlist led to the present circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.74,0:03:23.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That is what it seems like to me, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.45,0:03:25.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who cares about the hows and whys?!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.54,0:03:29.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We'll find out what they were as soon\Nas we get those Narcotics bastards!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.12,0:03:31.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't get so worked up over these memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.62,0:03:35.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The media should be broadcasting\Nfalsified information already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.84,0:03:37.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The truth has been erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.13,0:03:41.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, who is this Imakurusu person?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.18,0:03:47.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Imakurusu Hisahi, the former Chairman of\Nthe Central Drug Evaluation Committee.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.06,0:03:51.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,An authority on cyberbrain sclerosis, as well as\Nthe chairman of the Medical Association in Japan
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.77,0:03:54.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even though he has retired from his\Npost on the evaluation committee,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.15,0:03:57.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,he is thought to have maintained\Nstrong connections with the Ministry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.15,0:04:00.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right, Major, go to Imakurusu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.57,0:04:04.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will investigate how the Narcotic's\Nassault team came to intervene.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.07,0:04:06.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:10.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Pazu and Saitou,\Ncome with me to Imakurusu's residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.00,0:04:13.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou, you will continue to analyse\NTogusa's memory with Ishikawa and Bomer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.79,0:04:14.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.92,0:04:16.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I should be investigating Narcotics!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.21,0:04:19.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And what do you intend to do\Nafter going there in such a mood?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.51,0:04:20.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll call you if need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.09,0:04:23.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What mood {\i1}do{\i} I need to be in, then?!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.22,0:04:26.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She means to say that you need to cool off a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.72,0:04:29.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're saying that we should\Nfeel fine after seeing that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.10,0:04:31.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Right now, you're affected by Togusa's memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.52,0:04:32.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Her decision is sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:42.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:44.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And just who may you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.99,0:04:46.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm Aramaki from Public Safety Section 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.28,0:04:51.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I heard that orders for the sweep of the\NSunflower Society, which was conducted last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.29,0:04:54.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,bypassed the chief of Narcotics\Nand came directly from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:56.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I would like to hear your reasons for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.50,0:04:57.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.09,0:04:59.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.50,0:05:02.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm about to meet with the press.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.38,0:05:04.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Members of the Sunflower Society are a sly lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:10.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In order to proceed with due caution, only the members\Nof the assault team were to be aware of the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.97,0:05:15.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Unfortunately, the members of the Sunflower Society\Nindicated that they were prepared to resist at all cost,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.90,0:05:19.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,so we were forced to use extreme measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.98,0:05:22.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They even set fire to the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.11,0:05:25.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief, it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.57,0:05:28.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It seems that we do not have to intervene, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.49,0:05:32.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, there is one thing\NI am still concerned about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:36.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I believe that it must be due to some coincidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:42.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but one of our own happened\Nto be at the scene last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.51,0:05:47.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now then, we shall meet again someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.64,0:05:54.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is that all right, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.06,0:05:56.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let him be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.48,0:05:59.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If he took the trouble of coming here,\Nthen it means that he has nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.06,0:06:01.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Gayle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.36,0:06:03.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's of no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.94,0:06:05.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It seems that he has already left the premises.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.07,0:06:07.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Public Safety's on to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.07,0:06:09.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We don't have much time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.28,0:06:09.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Public Safety?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.95,0:06:11.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Section 9!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:13.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Get to Imakurusu before they do!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.74,0:06:16.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ah yes, that group of soldiers-turned-cyborgs?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.25,0:06:19.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In that case, I may need "that".
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:23.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The thing I have been requesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.96,0:06:25.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:27.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll make the necessary arrangements for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.47,0:06:31.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, do not leave any evidence if\Nyou come in contact with Section 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.85,0:06:33.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.18,0:06:34.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Without a trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.35,0:06:39.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Will you betray me now that we've come to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.48,0:06:43.79,Default,,0,0,900,,IMAKURUSU
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.44,0:06:46.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.87,0:06:54.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The starting signal, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.37,0:06:56.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief, we were late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.54,0:06:58.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It appears that there were\Nvisitors who came before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.54,0:07:00.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It must have been the assault team.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.96,0:07:04.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, judging from the circumstances,\NImakurusu appears to have fled in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.34,0:07:05.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.67,0:07:09.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If so, then there is a high possibility\Nthat he will use some sort of communication.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.34,0:07:10.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:14.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Perhaps we should ask a favour\Nof the American Empire's NRO?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.93,0:07:17.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You mean the global satellite\Ncommunications interception network?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.43,0:07:18.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.43,0:07:19.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.27,0:07:19.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Permission granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.14,0:07:22.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will have the Ministry of Foreign\NAffairs grant permission ex post facto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.56,0:07:25.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have enough favours piled up with the CIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.15,0:07:25.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.44,0:07:28.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's time for Big Brother to make an appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:31.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We can now tap all communications\Nin Japan in real time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.35,0:07:57.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.35,0:07:59.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,God, not only is the amount of data\Nenough to crash the terminals within
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.43,0:08:01.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,this building, but it's enough to crash\Nthose within a one kilometre radius
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.85,0:08:05.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Maybe we'll ask for backup from the old geezers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.32,0:08:13.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Damn it, this is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.91,0:08:16.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I shouldn't have run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.12,0:08:18.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was you who stole the file!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.70,0:08:22.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now, I wouldn't be surprised if they\Nthought I was the one who betrayed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.54,0:08:26.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You wouldn't have become serious if I\Nhadn't taken these measures, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.21,0:08:30.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They are not as lenient as\Nyou would like to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.01,0:08:34.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I feel sorry for the Sunflower Society's members.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.64,0:08:38.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, I have already decided\Nthat I will not give up until I have
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.31,0:08:42.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,exposed what went on behind the\Nadvancement of micromachine treatments.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.31,0:08:44.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You are a naive one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.31,0:08:46.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If we had approved the vaccine at the\Ntime, it would have been quite possible
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.69,0:08:48.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,that the achievements of cyberbrain\Ntechnology would have been rejected,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.94,0:08:51.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,despite the technology’s ongoing\Napplication in various fields and continuing
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.36,0:08:53.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,development, and that we would have\Nsuffered regression as a result.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.57,0:08:58.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, no law condones the\Nsuppression of valid research results.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.58,0:08:59.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You misunderstand!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.87,0:09:03.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I did not blindly object to the vaccine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.16,0:09:07.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was prepared to approve it on the\Ncondition that sufficient data was collected.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.67,0:09:11.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then, what was the basis upon which SERANO\NGenomix's utility design was approved
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.59,0:09:14.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,within a mere three months,\Ndespite the fact that SERANO
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.26,0:09:17.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Genomix was a latecomer in\Nmicromachine research at the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:19.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That was all according to a\Npredetermined trajectory that was
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.35,0:09:21.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,paved at the Ministry of Health,\NLabour and Welfare's initiative!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.60,0:09:24.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We on the Committee were just made to look like fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.48,0:09:26.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A convenient excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:31.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Similarly, the Micromachine\NIndustries company that you directed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.28,0:09:33.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,had its design approved within one month.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.20,0:09:39.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And in return, you people raked in\Nannual profits of one trillion yen
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.87,0:09:42.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,from protein particles that had no\Neffect against cyberbrain sclerosis!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.87,0:09:46.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was obviously a fraud committed\Nunder the government's direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.00,0:09:52.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The poor ignorant patients who believed in the\Ntreatment and died after paying high medical fees...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.38,0:09:54.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just how do you intend to make excuses for them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.80,0:09:59.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Micromachine have now been shown to\Nbe effective to a certain degree!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.18,0:10:05.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You cannot definitely say that it ended in catastrophe\Nso far as the treatment of sclerosis went.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.60,0:10:10.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If so, then why do you not treat your\Nown condition with micromachines?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.49,0:10:23.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You were the only person who was in a position\Ncapable of preventing this lamentable situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.79,0:10:28.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You chose a career to save lives;\Nwhy did you not decide to do so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.25,0:10:36.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I had prided myself on being committed to a life\Ndedicated to the treatment of cyberbrain sclerosis!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.26,0:10:38.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But Murai-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.38,0:10:40.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Beat you to your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.97,0:10:43.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Was it envy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.27,0:10:47.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I heard that you even went through\Nthe trouble of having a "not
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.81,0:10:51.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,approved" seal specially made\Nto destroy the Murai vaccine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.19,0:10:57.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now, they gloat on their thrones after\Ntaking advantage of your damned petty pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.86,0:11:00.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you know that much,\Nwhat is it that you want me to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.16,0:11:05.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're quite capable of invading my\Ncyberbrain and taking over, ghost and all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.45,0:11:08.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There is no point in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.29,0:11:13.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now that your life is being\Nmaintained by that vaccine,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.46,0:11:16.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,please disclose the truth of your own free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.76,0:11:19.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Whether you spend the rest\Nof your days as a good man
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.59,0:11:22.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,or be pointed out as a heartless\Ncriminal after your death,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:24.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the choice is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.06,0:11:28.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Laughing Man... just who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:32.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why did you, who displays such blatant heroism,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.35,0:11:36.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,commit such acts of corporate terrorism\Nand obtain a massive amount of money?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.98,0:11:40.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have never said that I was the Laughing Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.07,0:11:45.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Besides, there is another who used\Ncorporate terrorism to steal money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.29,0:11:48.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It can't be...!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.95,0:11:50.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It is as you realised.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.87,0:11:52.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.17,0:11:55.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If we are to bring them to justice,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.46,0:11:59.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,we need another playing\Ncard besides your testimony.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:03.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Until I return, please do not leave\Nthis room under any circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.89,0:12:05.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.69,0:12:15.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.61,0:12:17.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Um, did you need anything, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:19.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.69,0:12:20.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.32,0:12:22.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Excuse me, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.70,0:12:26.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.20,0:12:30.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is there a public terminal somewhere near here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.58,0:12:35.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:38.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,His blood pressure is stable as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.25,0:12:39.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.09,0:12:41.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.26,0:12:47.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, if he experiences some sort\Nof physical disability or aftereffects,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.55,0:12:50.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,he may just have to resign himself\Nto getting some cybernetic implants.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.91,0:13:09.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sorry about the foul weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.29,0:13:10.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.00,0:13:14.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Today was the only day that worked for us, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.08,0:13:19.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's me, Imakurusu. Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.21,0:13:21.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please clear Niimi's doubts about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.09,0:13:24.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, at that golf course I told you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.80,0:13:25.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.06,0:13:32.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Big Brother's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.35,0:13:33.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We don't know for sure yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.64,0:13:37.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All it means is that our voice\Npattern filter caught "Imakurusu".
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.44,0:13:42.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Correlating voice pattern of caller\Nwith that of Imakurusu Hisahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.03,0:13:46.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Correlation with Imakurusu Hisashi's\Nvoice pattern is 36% complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.44,0:13:45.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Determining location of terminal\Nused by caller, starting search.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.24,0:13:48.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Proceeding to determine location of\Nterminal, starting search.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.82,0:13:50.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Determined signal origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.83,0:13:51.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Proceeding to trace signal path.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.16,0:13:53.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Hey, the operators are crashing in droves!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.24,0:13:54.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Proceeding to activate trace program\Nvia communication satellites.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.16,0:13:54.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}We have backups.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.21,0:14:05.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, we're lucky today!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.22,0:14:07.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're getting hits all over the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.22,0:14:09.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's to pay you for borrowing your cyberbrains.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.35,0:14:10.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're a crook.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.72,0:14:14.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,After all, even if they're old, if you hook them up\Nin parallel, you can get a lot of power out of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.73,0:14:16.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.94,0:14:21.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We have just determined the location\Nwhere Imakurusu used the terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.02,0:14:24.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now, we will confirm whether it was him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.12,0:14:33.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief, a direct call.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.62,0:14:33.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:35.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is Niimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.25,0:14:37.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is that true?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.58,0:14:38.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.96,0:14:40.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, I will take care of it immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.30,0:14:45.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is that you, Gayle? It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.80,0:14:47.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We have Imakurusu's location!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.51,0:14:48.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's at Kouhoku Country Club!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.01,0:14:50.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Get over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.93,0:14:52.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The idiot...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.60,0:14:56.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He chose the wrong one to run to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.89,0:14:59.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He is at Kouhoku Country Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.81,0:15:05.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,His presence was confirmed two minutes ago at the terminal\Nthat is located on the northern pedestrian walkway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.33,0:15:14.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's a match!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.95,0:15:16.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, what concerns me is who he called-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:17.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who cares as long as we know where he is?!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.75,0:15:19.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Old man, we'll be faster than the Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.75,0:15:20.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm going out in the chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:22.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right, get him before anyone else does.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.04,0:15:25.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ishikawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.13,0:15:26.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you able to trace Imakurusu?!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.84,0:15:29.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,After that, he went into room 909 in an annex.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.93,0:15:31.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He is stationary at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.93,0:15:33.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Bomer, what do you think about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.22,0:15:35.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.35,0:15:40.95,Default,,150,0,675,,{\b1}You are attempting to access a confidential government line. \N Please enter your password.{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.85,0:15:40.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A protected phone number that was assigned the highest\Npriority in the American Empire's surveillance list?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.56,0:15:43.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes. Officially, the number doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.02,0:15:46.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But isn't this the number for\Nthe ruling party's headquarters?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.16,0:15:53.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is it, squad leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.74,0:15:55.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How's the MSDF's 303 model?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.95,0:15:59.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Marine has a pretty artistic\Nform with its fluid lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.04,0:16:03.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now, if those Section 9 people show\Nup, we can get actual combat data.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.21,0:16:10.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Squad leader we have confirmed a chopper\Nthat's heading towards the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.01,0:16:11.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It appears to be Section 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.01,0:16:14.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh yeah? What good timing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.80,0:16:18.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right, you guys try to secure Imakurusu first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.22,0:16:20.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This one requires time for system start up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:22.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,After you guys cut off the escape\Nroute, leave the rest to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.40,0:16:29.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They're...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.87,0:16:41.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You are Imakurusu Hisahi, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.79,0:16:42.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:44.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,An Assault Team is coming.\NLet's get you out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.00,0:16:46.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't come near me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.98,0:17:09.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.69,0:17:11.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, barely,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.19,0:17:12.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but we're hemmed in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.40,0:17:14.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Can you evacuate using the chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.20,0:17:16.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Negative. Not while Imakurusu is with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.28,0:17:17.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.91,0:17:18.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.29,0:17:31.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even if they are invisible, it doesn't mean\Nthat their very existence is invisible as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.59,0:17:33.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How are they going to advance?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.02,0:17:49.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is that you, Major?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.73,0:17:52.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have secured an escape route.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.44,0:17:54.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's return to the lobby for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.95,0:17:56.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.55,0:18:14.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Down!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.34,0:18:20.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.47,0:18:25.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,An Armour Suit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.77,0:18:29.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou, I will distract it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.77,0:18:32.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't be an idiot! That's my role!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.65,0:18:34.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's not that I don't have confidence in you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:35.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but that thing cannot be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.65,0:18:36.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is a direct order!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.86,0:18:38.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Take Imakurusu and evacuate the premises!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.49,0:18:40.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Damn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.20,0:18:41.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't get done in by that thing, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.26,0:19:00.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, we'll be there shortly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.03,0:20:06.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Not even a direct hit can pierce its armour?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.88,0:20:23.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Saitou! Hand that thing over!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.56,0:20:35.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,H-hey, open the hatch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.53,0:20:39.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.89,0:21:08.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I-I can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.56,0:21:10.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.65,0:21:17.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,More this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.86,0:21:18.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.00,0:21:34.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Put him on the chopper and be quick about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.66,0:21:35.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.92,0:21:40.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The idiot... Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:42.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, you two! Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.43,0:21:47.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right, don't move, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.56,0:21:59.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Imakurusu!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.73,0:22:04.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Imakurusu was hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.36,0:22:05.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Call for an ambulance!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.99,0:22:14.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Laughing Man... is that who you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.37,0:22:15.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.00,0:22:18.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you say "Laughing Man"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.08,0:22:20.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.84,0:22:26.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This file is...!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.42,0:22:26.90,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1}LIST OF MURAI VACCINE RECIPIENTS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.60,0:22:33.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thermo-optical camouflage?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.31,0:22:35.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, that's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.23,0:22:39.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You bastard... you stole my eyes, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.49,0:22:49.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Where are you?! Are you still nearby?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.45,0:22:54.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Where are you?!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.57,0:24:13.28,Default,,0,0,900,,She's so cold and human
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.49,0:24:16.99,Default,,0,0,900,,It's something humans do
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.45,0:24:21.50,Default,,0,0,900,,She stays so cold in her soul, she's so number 9
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.79,0:24:24.75,Default,,0,0,900,,She's incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.75,0:24:29.13,Default,,0,0,900,,Just incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.22,0:24:33.59,Default,,0,0,900,,And is she really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.68,0:24:36.76,Default,,0,0,900,,She says there's something new
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.51,0:24:41.52,Default,,0,0,900,,But wake a lithium flower, just about to bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.69,0:24:44.40,Default,,0,0,900,,I smell lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.36,0:24:49.15,Default,,0,0,900,,Smelling lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.78,0:24:53.99,Default,,0,0,900,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.99,0:24:54.49,Default,,0,0,900,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.66,0:24:57.28,Default,,0,0,900,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.08,0:24:59.29,Default,,0,0,900,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.66,0:25:01.54,Default,,0,0,900,,How is she when she doesn't suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.62,0:25:04.62,Default,,0,0,900,,I wonder what she does when she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.17,0:25:08.46,Default,,0,0,900,,When she wakes up
